{"v":1,"by":"the-game-bureau","isNew":false,"at":1795763083361,"game":{"kit":"notebook","layout":"product","slug":"wordfleet2","title":"WORD FLEET","kicker":"The Game Bureau presents","brand":{"color":"#2D5016","accent":"#FFD400","paper":"#FFFDF5","ink":"#101510"},"tagline":"One sentence that says what the game is and why it's fun.","shareText":"WORD FLEET: One sentence that says what the game is and why it's fun.","announce":"","price":"$9.99","currency":"USD","order":{"url":"","label":"ORDER PRINTED NOTEBOOK","shippingNote":"Shipping calculated at checkout."},"media":[{"type":"image","src":"images/wfbg.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"images/battle-sheet-preview.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"video","src":"/studio/assets/notebook-open.mp4","alt":"Placeholder video","placeholder":true}],"aboutHeading":"What it is","description":["Open the notebook, grab a pencil, and challenge a friend to a duel of hidden words. Each battle sheet gives you one grid to hide your word-ships and another to track your shots, guesses, and clues."],"specs":[["CAPTAINS","2"],["TIME","About 10 minutes"],["AGES","9+"]],"stepsHeading":"How it works","steps":[{"title":"PLOT YOUR FLEET","text":"Each captain tears a Battle Tracker out of the notebook and keeps the printed words hidden from their opponent. Place your five words of 5, 4, 3, 3, and 2 letters on your Defense Grid, across or down, one letter per square."},{"title":"Play","text":"Start your attack by guessing one whole enemy word-ship. A correct guess lets you call a coordinate and take a shot. A wrong guess ends your turn. If your shot hits, take one guess at the letter in that square."},{"title":"DEMAND SURRENDER","text":"When you think you’ve found the entire fleet, name all five words and their exact locations. Get them all right and you win. One wrong word or location costs you the game."}],"videoHeading":"See it played","rulesBlurb":"Everything you need to play, on one page. The same rules are printed inside the notebook.","setup":{},"print":{"trim":[8.5,11],"bleed":0.125,"margin":0.5,"spinePerPage":0.002252,"padTo":2,"sheets":72,"author":"The Game Bureau"},"subtitle":"SINK OR SPELL","rulesLink":"https://thegamebureau.com/wordfleet/rules-of-engagement.html"},"rules":"<h1>{{title}} rules</h1>\n\n<p>You need this notebook and a pencil. Play with 2 to 6 players.</p>\n\n<h2>Setup</h2>\n\n<ol>\n  <li><strong>First step.</strong> Say what players do before the first round.</li>\n  <li><strong>Second step.</strong> Keep each step short.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>Playing a round</h2>\n\n<ol>\n  <li><strong>Do this.</strong> One idea per step.</li>\n  <li><strong>Then this.</strong> Bold the name of the step.</li>\n  <li><strong>Score it.</strong> Say where in the notebook the score is written.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>Winning</h2>\n\n<p>Say how the game ends and who wins.</p>\n\n<aside class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Tip.</strong> A box like this calls out an example or an exception.</p></aside>\n","cover":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex\">\n<title>Cover</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/studio/kit/print.css\">\n<script src=\"/studio/kit/kit.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/studio/kit/print.js\"></script>\n<!--\n  COVER. Design the front and the back here; print.js places them:\n    ?layout=spread  back | spine | front, with bleed (the printer's cover PDF)\n    ?layout=front   front alone at trim size (first page of the print-at-home and sampler PDFs)\n    ?layout=back    back alone at trim size (last page of those PDFs)\n  .cover-front and .cover-back fill their panel to the bleed edge, with padding set for you so\n  content stays in the safe area. .cover-spine shows only when the spine is wide enough.\n  Leave the lower right of the back clear (about 2 x 1.2 in) if the printer adds a barcode.\n  Filled from game.json: {{title}} {{subtitle}} {{tagline}} {{kicker}} {{url}} {{price}},\n  and as HTML: {{steps}} {{specs}} {{description}} {{image}} {{qr}} {{stepsHeading}} (the photo marked FOR NOTEBOOK COVER in Media, or squares when none is). Colours: var(--brand) var(--accent) var(--paper) var(--ink).\n-->\n<style>\n.cover-front{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;justify-content:space-between}\n.cover-front .kick{font:800 10pt \"NB Text\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.3em;color:var(--accent)}\n.cover-front h1{font-size:92pt;line-height:.9;margin-top:.2in;text-transform:uppercase;max-width:6.6in}\n.cover-front .sub{font:400 26pt \"NB Display\",Impact,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;margin-top:10pt;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase}\n.cover-front .foot{border-top:2pt solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);padding-top:10pt;font:700 13pt \"NB Text\",sans-serif;max-width:6in}\n\n/* BACK: \"Poster\". The main colour to the bleed, photo 1 echoed faintly behind so the wrap\n   reads as one piece, the kicker at the very top, then the title, the hook in the accent\n   colour and the tagline, and a footer band with a QR code to the game page and room for a barcode. */\n.cover-back{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;overflow:hidden;gap:0}\n.cover-back .bk-echo{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;bottom:0;overflow:hidden;z-index:0}\n.cover-back .bk-echo .pk-image{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;max-height:none;margin:0;border-radius:0;object-fit:cover;filter:grayscale(1) contrast(1.15);mix-blend-mode:luminosity;opacity:.28}\n.cover-back .bk-echo .pk-art{display:none}\n.cover-back .bk-echo::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,color-mix(in srgb,var(--brand) 20%,transparent) 30%,var(--brand) 92%)}\n.cover-back>*:not(.bk-echo){position:relative;z-index:1}\n.cover-back .bk-kick{font:800 9.5pt \"NB Text\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)}\n.cover-back .bk-title{font:400 92pt/.9 \"NB Display\",Impact,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.01em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:.4in;max-width:7in;text-wrap:balance}\n.cover-back h2{font-size:40pt;line-height:.95;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);margin-top:14pt;max-width:6.6in}\n.cover-back h2:empty{display:none}\n.cover-back h2{text-wrap:balance}\n.cover-back .bk-tag{font:500 15pt/1.4 \"NB Text\",sans-serif;margin:16pt 0 0;max-width:6in}\n.cover-back .bk-foot{margin:auto calc(-1 * var(--pad)) calc(-1 * var(--pad));padding:.22in var(--pad) var(--pad);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:14pt}\n.cover-back .pk-qr{width:1.05in;height:1.05in;color:var(--ink);flex:none}\n.cover-back .bk-scan{font:400 10pt/1.35 \"NB Text\",sans-serif;flex:1}\n.cover-back .bk-scan b{display:block;font:400 17pt/1 \"NB Display\",Impact,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.03em;color:var(--brand);margin-bottom:4pt;text-transform:uppercase}\n.cover-back .bk-url{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.02em}\n.barcode-space{width:2in;height:1.2in;flex:none;background:#fff}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"cover\">\n\n<div class=\"cover-front\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"kick\">The Game Bureau presents</div>\n    <h1>{{title}}</h1>\n  </div>\n  {{image}}\n  <div class=\"foot\">{{tagline}}</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"cover-spine\">The Game Bureau presents · {{title}}</div>\n\n<div class=\"cover-back\">\n  <div class=\"bk-echo\">{{image}}</div>\n  <div class=\"bk-kick\">{{kicker}}</div>\n  <div class=\"bk-title\">{{title}}</div>\n  <h2>{{subtitle}}</h2>\n  <p class=\"bk-tag\">{{tagline}}</p>\n  <div class=\"bk-foot\">\n    {{qr}}\n    <div class=\"bk-scan\"><b>Scan to play along</b>Rules, a how-to-play video and more at<br><span class=\"bk-url\">{{url}}</span></div>\n    <div class=\"barcode-space\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n","contents":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex\">\n<title>Contents</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/studio/kit/print.css\">\n<script src=\"/studio/kit/kit.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/studio/kit/print.js\"></script>\n<!--\n  CONTENTS: every inside page of the notebook, in order.\n  - <section data-rules> is replaced by rules.md and flows onto as many pages as it needs.\n  - Each <section class=\"page\"> is one fixed page; its padding keeps content in the safe area.\n  - <template data-repeat=\"N\" data-per=\"2\"> repeats its pages N times. Inside it, {{n}} numbers\n    the copies (1, 2, 3...) and {{i}} {{i+1}} number the items on each copy (1-2, 3-4...).\n    {{sheets}} is print.sheets in game.json (set on the admin page).\n  - Filled from game.json: {{title}} {{subtitle}} {{tagline}} {{url}} {{price}} {{sheets}}.\n-->\n<style>\n.page h2{font-size:28pt;color:var(--brand)}\n.page .lede{margin:4pt 0 12pt;font-size:10pt}\n.grid{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed}\n.grid th,.grid td{border:1pt solid var(--ink);height:.3in;font-size:9pt;text-align:center}\n.grid thead th{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font:400 11pt \"NB Display\",Impact,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em;height:.42in}\n.grid th.r{width:.7in;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 25%,#fff);color:var(--ink);font:400 11pt \"NB Display\",Impact,sans-serif}\n.grid tfoot th,.grid tfoot td{height:.42in;border-width:2pt}\n\n.sheet{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10pt}\n.sheet-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:2pt solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:4pt}\n.sheet-head .fill{display:flex;gap:16pt;font:800 8pt \"NB Text\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em}\n.sheet-head .fill span{border-bottom:1pt solid var(--ink);min-width:1.3in}\n.notes{flex:1;border:1pt solid var(--ink);border-radius:4pt;padding:8pt;font:800 8pt \"NB Text\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(transparent 0 .3in,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 25%,transparent) .3in calc(.3in + .6pt))}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"contents\">\n\n<section data-rules></section>\n\n<section class=\"page\">\n  <h2>{{title}} Score Book</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\">Write each player's name at the top of a column. Record every game in its row.</p>\n  <table class=\"grid\">\n    <thead><tr><th class=\"r\">GAME</th><th>PLAYER 1</th><th>PLAYER 2</th><th>PLAYER 3</th><th>PLAYER 4</th><th>PLAYER 5</th><th>PLAYER 6</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody id=\"score-rows\"></tbody>\n    <tfoot><tr><th class=\"r\">TOTAL</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tfoot>\n  </table>\n</section>\n\n<template data-repeat=\"{{sheets}}\">\n  <section class=\"page sheet\">\n    <div class=\"sheet-head\"><h2>{{title}} · GAME {{n}}</h2><div class=\"fill\"><span>DATE</span><span>WINNER</span></div></div>\n    <table class=\"grid\">\n      <thead><tr><th class=\"r\">ROUND</th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">1</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">2</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">3</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">4</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">5</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">6</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">7</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">8</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n      <tfoot><tr><th class=\"r\">TOTAL</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tfoot>\n    </table>\n    <div class=\"notes\">NOTES</div>\n  </section>\n</template>\n\n<script>\n// Score Book rows: one per game sheet.\n(function () {\n  const n = 24;\n  let rows = '';\n  for (let r = 1; r <= n; r++) rows += '<tr><th class=\"r\">' + r + '</th>' + '<td></td>'.repeat(6) + '</tr>';\n  document.getElementById('score-rows').innerHTML = rows;\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","sampler":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex\">\n<title>Sampler</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/studio/kit/print.css\">\n<script src=\"/studio/kit/kit.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/studio/kit/print.js\"></script>\n<!--\n  SAMPLER: the free sampler's own pages, in order. Its PDF is the front cover, these pages and\n  the back cover, and it is the free download on the game page. Separate from contents.html.\n  - <section data-rules> is replaced by rules.md and flows onto as many pages as it needs.\n  - Each <section class=\"page\"> is one fixed page; its padding keeps content in the safe area.\n  - <template data-repeat=\"N\" data-per=\"2\"> repeats its pages N times. Inside it, {{n}} numbers\n    the copies (1, 2, 3...) and {{i}} {{i+1}} number the items on each copy (1-2, 3-4...).\n    {{sheets}} is print.sheets in game.json (set on the admin page).\n  - Filled from game.json: {{title}} {{subtitle}} {{tagline}} {{url}} {{price}} {{sheets}}.\n-->\n<style>\n.page h2{font-size:28pt;color:var(--brand)}\n.page .lede{margin:4pt 0 12pt;font-size:10pt}\n.grid{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed}\n.grid th,.grid td{border:1pt solid var(--ink);height:.3in;font-size:9pt;text-align:center}\n.grid thead th{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font:400 11pt \"NB Display\",Impact,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em;height:.42in}\n.grid th.r{width:.7in;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 25%,#fff);color:var(--ink);font:400 11pt \"NB Display\",Impact,sans-serif}\n.grid tfoot th,.grid tfoot td{height:.42in;border-width:2pt}\n\n.sheet{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10pt}\n.sheet-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;border-bottom:2pt solid var(--ink);padding-bottom:4pt}\n.sheet-head .fill{display:flex;gap:16pt;font:800 8pt \"NB Text\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em}\n.sheet-head .fill span{border-bottom:1pt solid var(--ink);min-width:1.3in}\n.notes{flex:1;border:1pt solid var(--ink);border-radius:4pt;padding:8pt;font:800 8pt \"NB Text\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(transparent 0 .3in,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 25%,transparent) .3in calc(.3in + .6pt))}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"contents\">\n\n<section data-rules></section>\n\n<section class=\"page\">\n  <h2>{{title}} Score Book</h2>\n  <p class=\"lede\">Write each player's name at the top of a column. Record every game in its row.</p>\n  <table class=\"grid\">\n    <thead><tr><th class=\"r\">GAME</th><th>PLAYER 1</th><th>PLAYER 2</th><th>PLAYER 3</th><th>PLAYER 4</th><th>PLAYER 5</th><th>PLAYER 6</th></tr></thead>\n    <tbody id=\"score-rows\"></tbody>\n    <tfoot><tr><th class=\"r\">TOTAL</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tfoot>\n  </table>\n</section>\n\n<template data-repeat=\"1\">\n  <section class=\"page sheet\">\n    <div class=\"sheet-head\"><h2>{{title}} · GAME {{n}}</h2><div class=\"fill\"><span>DATE</span><span>WINNER</span></div></div>\n    <table class=\"grid\">\n      <thead><tr><th class=\"r\">ROUND</th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">1</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">2</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">3</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">4</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">5</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">6</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">7</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n        <tr><th class=\"r\">8</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n      <tfoot><tr><th class=\"r\">TOTAL</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tfoot>\n    </table>\n    <div class=\"notes\">NOTES</div>\n  </section>\n</template>\n\n<script>\n// Score Book rows: one per game sheet.\n(function () {\n  const n = 24;\n  let rows = '';\n  for (let r = 1; r <= n; r++) rows += '<tr><th class=\"r\">' + r + '</th>' + '<td></td>'.repeat(6) + '</tr>';\n  document.getElementById('score-rows').innerHTML = rows;\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","files":{}}